#. ja: “朕はイヴァリースの王　アルガスなり！<br>朕の眠りを妨げるはなにゆえか？”
#. de: Wer wagt es, die Ruhe von Argath Thadalfus zu stören, dem Herrscher über ganz Ivalice?
#. fr: “Je suis Argath, roi d'Ivalice<nbsp>! Qui ose troubler mon sommeil<nbsp>?”
#. speaker: ALGUS
msgctxt "cut_scene/041/VoiceMan_04101:TEXT_VOICEMAN_04101_000010_ALGUS:1"
msgid "Who dares disturb the slumber of Argath Thadalfus, rightful king of Ivalice!?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: “貴様はベオルブ家の末裔か……？<br>ならば　朕　みずからの剣にて葬るのみよ！！”
#. de: Seid ihr Nachfahren des Hauses Beoulve? Dann soll mein Schwert euch richten!
#. fr: “Des descendants de la maison Beoulve<nbsp>? Dans ce cas, de mon épée, je vais détruire vos âmes<nbsp>!”
#. speaker: ALGUS
msgctxt "cut_scene/041/VoiceMan_04101:TEXT_VOICEMAN_04101_000011_ALGUS:1"
msgid "Descendants of House Beoulve? Then by my sword shall I banish your souls to the deepest hell!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: “オレはいったい…？　どうしてここに……！？<br>なんだ…この身体は？　助けて…くれ…ラム…ザ……！”
#. de: Was hat das ...? Wo bin ich? Warum seh ich so aus? Ramza! Hol mich hier raus!
#. fr: “Mais que fais-je... ici<nbsp>!?<nbsp>... Et qu'est-il... arrivé à mon corps<nbsp>!?<nbsp>... Au secours... Ramza<nbsp>!<nbsp>...”
#. speaker: ALGUS
msgctxt "cut_scene/041/VoiceMan_04101:TEXT_VOICEMAN_04101_000020_ALGUS:1"
msgid "Where... Where am I? This body... It is not my own. Oh, gods, what have I done? Save me Ramza! Save me!"
msgstr ""
